WEBVTT

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.810
Hell Throw!

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.650
Take a flying leap!

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.670
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.920
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:19.370
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.560
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:07.980
<b>Is There a Special Move?</b>

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.890
<b>Ishiyama Park</b>

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.100
Once upon a time, in a land far far away,

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:18.270
there was a barbaric, ruthless, and defiant,

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:23.160
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.480
And that man's name was...

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.800
Oga!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.420
Kanzaki-san! I brought you supplies.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.590
So? How is it going?

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.790
I've come up with my new special move!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.530
T-That's...

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.730
Twice the power of my old heel drop...

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.750
T-Twice?!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.240
Double Heel Smash!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:26.430
Kanzaki...-san?

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:37.360
I thought I could double the 
power by dropping both heels,

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.730
But, how do I do it?

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.140
Uh...

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.890
So, working hard?

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.000
Natsume! What are you here for?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:50.450
I thought you were hanging 
around Oga lately...

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:55.560
Now, now... I've been collecting 
some useful information.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:04.880
I secretly filmed how Oga-chan fights.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.230
Just look at Oga-chan go...

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:25.310
T-That's...!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.660
I've figured it out, Kanzaki-san!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.990
I've figured out the 
secret to Oga's strength!

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.160
What?!

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.030
What do you think? You'll 
carry a baby on your back,

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.060
which will help polish your balance,

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:47.200
and by adding weight, you'll train 
your body to be more powerful!

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.900
That's the secret to Oga's strength!

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.810
Sure... But this...

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.390
What are you saying? Don't 
you want to beat Oga?

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.500
F-Fine...

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.120
This will be perfect.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:15.570
I'm sure Oga's raising a baby just like this,

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:18.130
and undergoing harsh training every day!

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:35.270
The master is saying he wishes 
to go outside somewhere.

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.690
What a pain. Maybe some other time.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.720
What <i>is</i> that?

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.940
I'm scared, Mom!

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.050
Shouldn't we call the police?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:59.100
Hey. Shiroyama... Don't you get the 
feeling... people are looking at us funny?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.060
No, it's your imagination.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.690
I-Is it?

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.520
Anyway, Kanzaki-san...

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:05.540
What is it?

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:08.130
The head fell off.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.490
Hey, Kanzaki-kun!

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:17.150
I don't think doing only that will 
give you a power wrist effect.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.270
I bought dumbbells.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:21.310
I see!

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.300
This ain't nothing.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:33.960
Nothing! Nothing at all!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.100
Then... a little more.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.820
More! Put in more!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:53.530
More...

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.570
Kanzaki-san, look what I found!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:58.310
There's more?!

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.420
Kanzaki-san!

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:01.560
Oh?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.140
Kanzaki-san...

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.490
The problem was that we were using a fake.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:09.920
What do you mean?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.560
Basically, if it were a real baby, instead...

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.830
I see.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:18.350
But where are you going 
to get this "real" baby?

00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:20.600
W-Well...

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.220
Just leave that much to me.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:31.660
What's this thing you wanted 
to talk with me about?

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.810
I have a favor to ask, Pops!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.890
A favor?

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.330
Make me a little brother, right now!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.600
<b>Kanzaki</b>

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.100
Kanzaki-san!

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:53.160
Kanzaki-kun's old man is 
quite scary, isn't he?

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.930
Damn you, Pops!

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:58.170
Not even listening to the 
requests of his own kid!

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:04.280
Maybe it doesn't really 
matter if it's a baby...

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:05.740
What do you mean?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:07.750
Right... For instance...

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.450
Wait! Wait there, cat!

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.400
This is for Kanzaki-san's training!

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:25.490
How'd the cat idea go?

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:26.370
No use!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.320
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.290
It definitely needs to be a human!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.160
So, about that weird big guy 
at your house, Honoka...

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:37.700
Who is he?

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:40.060
That guy named Dron-dron or something?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:44.920
I don't really know myself. My brother 
just brought him home one day.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.040
You three!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:53.320
Please! For Kanzaki-san's 
sake, will you ride on him?!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.520
Yeah, can't get around that...

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.450
A doll isn't going to work. 
Neither is a real baby.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.170
Cats and middle school girls are also nixed.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:08.850
All that's left is...

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.050
Kanzaki-san...

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:13.570
Shiroyama.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.100
Where did you go?

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.550
U-Um...

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:24.460
Please, make use of me, Kanzaki-san!

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.080
You are...

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:33.590
I know that I'm far bigger 
and heavier than a baby.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.600
But even so, I want to be of 
assistance to you, Kanzaki-san!

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:39.660
Yeah... I see your point, but...

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.020
Kanzaki-san!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.640
Don't you want to beat Oga?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.670
A-All right...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:54.650
Kanzaki-san...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.500
Wait.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:59.200
That's not going to work.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:03.410
It's not just your size and 
weight that's different.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.570
There's also a crucial 
difference with Oga's baby.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:07.750
Crucial...

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:09.210
...difference?

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:15.540
Could you mean...

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:19.750
Yes! The baby on Oga-chan's 
back is always naked!

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:20.930
Naked!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:21.700
Naked?

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.850
Naked...

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.650
Naked!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.330
Don't do it, Shiroyama!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.400
You really don't have to go that far...

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.580
No, I'll do it!

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:38.390
If it's for you, Kanzaki-san, I'll...

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.060
How about this?

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.480
U-Uh...

00:10:43.480 --> 00:10:46.370
Now hurry up and put me on your back!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.290
This sure is tricky.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.120
Anyway, what should we try next?

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.480
Enough.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:57.910
Kanzaki-san!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.330
Leave me alone.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.910
Kanzaki-kun's all down in the dumps.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.730
Natsume! This is all your fault!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.650
Ow! That hurts!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.780
Shit! Is it impossible for me to beat him?

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:24.590
Oga!

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:29.660
I told you. The master is bored.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.710
There is time before dinner.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:38.040
Take the master and go play somewhere.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:41.190
Can't I at least relax on Sundays?

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.830
Look now... The master is about to cry...

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.100
Fine, I'll do it!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.050
Take you to play somewhere, huh?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.670
Guess an arcade isn't gonna work.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.090
Maybe that park again?

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:16.750
Hey, Oga.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.250
Where are you going?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.100
Taking baby Beel to the park?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.720
I wish Hilda-san would come.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:30.720
Naw... It'd be a pain if she got 
in a fight with the other moms.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:31.890
Other moms?

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:32.850
Yeah...

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.480
Are they young?

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:38.700
I guess so. They're at least 
younger than your mom.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.300
How old are you?

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.170
You're cuter than my son!

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.850
Why don't we play together in the sandbox?

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:52.200
Okay, let's go to the park!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.530
Leave everything to me!

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.790
<b>Ishiyama Park</b>

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.740
Kota!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.880
Kota! Where did you go?

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:06.240
What'll I do?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.060
Hey! We sure meet up a lot.

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.340
With the kid again today?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.040
Actually...

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:17.520
That's the guy who's always sticking to Oga!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.190
Y-You're...

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:23.550
Crap! He's probably figured 
out my disguise, unlike Oga!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:24.750
I can't believe this!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.450
Well, sure it's unbelievable.

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:32.030
Me dressing so plainly and taking 
a kid to play in the park...

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:33.540
What a...

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:38.960
What a super-cute and young mother!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.100
Huh?

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:43.700
If someone said you were in high 
school I wouldn't bat an eye!

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.570
I would never think you had a kid!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.290
Um, that's not it...

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.270
Yes! That's not it!

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.950
Kota's missing!

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.850
Where're you from, kid?

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.740
You wanna get on the swing?

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:17.580
Hey, you okay?

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.870
What, you want me to swing you?

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.100
I suppose...

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.380
So, having fun?

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.810
Sheesh... I don't have time 
to be playing with this kid.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:51.750
Seriously.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.620
Oh yeah... Did you see it on TV yesterday?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:58.700
That's...

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.950
That's the violent man from before!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.710
You lost sight of him around here?

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:12.690
Yes. I took my eyes off 
of him for a second...

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.310
Oh, that's right!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:18.110
My little sister said there was 
a suspicious person around here!

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.650
O-Oh no!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.080
He's probably just playing 
around here somewhere.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:26.400
Oga... Are you saying that to calm me down?

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:31.620
He's so much kinder than he looks.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:37.660
I <i>wish</i> someone suspicious 
would just kidnap 'im.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:45.420
Hey! What do you think you're saying 
in front of this young mother!

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.130
Uh, like I was saying...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:51.320
Do not worry! I will find him for certain!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.040
U-Um...

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:20.790
I see now! When I have a real baby on my back, my 
reaction time and movements are all on another level!

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:24.300
As I am now, I can beat him!

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.700
Wait, it's no good.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.950
Before I perfect my new secret 
move, beating Oga would be...

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:42.480
Kids... Not a care in the world.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:55.580
T-That's it!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:58.080
Eureka!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.050
Sorry 'bout that. Just wait!

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.920
I'll find your mom soon.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:09.760
Kota!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.530
Oga?!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:17.360
Wait, aren't you...

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:19.450
Why does Kanzaki have Kota?

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.510
And... Kota's crying?

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:24.520
Aren't you...

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.360
Is my cover blown this time?

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:32.900
After a closer look...

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:38.450
Well, it's only normal. We're 
both part of the TKKH...

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.310
So, the jig's finally up?

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.990
You are quite the young mother.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.040
Perfect timing. I've been 
looking for his mom.

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:50.370
No...

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:53.670
You can't! You don't just want 
the baby but the mother too?!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:54.600
Huh?

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.560
You kidnap the cute kid, and on top of that,

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.940
you're trying to lay hands 
on his cute, young mother!

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:04.430
Even for a member of the 
TKKH, that's low, Kanzaki!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.950
What did you say?

00:18:06.420 --> 00:18:08.080
Oga! Do it!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.460
Do what?

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:13.620
He's a kidnapper. Do what 
you always do and blast him.

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:16.060
It's not what I <i>always</i> do...

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.700
W-What's this?

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:32.150
It's dangerous, Madam! Don't get close!

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:38.540
I see.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.310
I see. You want me to defeat Oga, yes?

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:47.980
All right, then.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.860
Our real battle starts now.

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.600
I can't have you getting hurt.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.460
Don't worry about me.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:06.650
I'm a different man than I once was.

00:19:08.210 --> 00:19:11.160
Here I go!

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:14.170
Hey! Wait up!

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.220
The hint that kid gave 
me for my special move...

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.190
Oga!

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:27.810
That technique...!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:32.600
Double Heel Smash!

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:34.770
I've got it!

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:48.930
Yo.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:50.340
Yo...

00:19:57.830 --> 00:19:59.850
So... What?

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.320
I see.

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:14.260
You kept Kota company when he got lost.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:15.500
Yeah.

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.260
I figured you were the 
weirdo my sister mentioned.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.300
I'm sorry for the mistake.

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.570
It's fine. By the way...

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.110
Have I seen you somewhere before?

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:32.480
H-Huh? Just your imagination!

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:32.870
Definitely!

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.250
I'm not sure, but that's definitely it!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.270
Fine, whatever.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.260
Anyway... Oga!

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:49.610
At this kid's request, 
I'll let you off today.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.640
Uh, let me off from what exactly?

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.200
But the next time we meet will be your last.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.550
Remember that well!

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.480
Don't cry, kid.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:10.930
Oh, yeah... That "Double" something or other.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:16.670
That was pretty surprising.

00:21:37.310 --> 00:21:40.010
But seriously... What?

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:43.330
Kanzaki-san!

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:46.600
You did the double heel smash!

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:51.700
For Oga-chan to say it surprised 
him, that's really something!

00:21:53.230 --> 00:21:55.100
Wait, Kanzaki-san!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:59.090
We brought you yogurti since 
you're likely tired out.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:00.490
You guys...

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:07.150
Fine, then... Follow me! We're going home!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:09.700
R-Right!

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.380
That's how it's gotta be!

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:12.640
Kanzaki-san!

00:24:02.530 --> 00:24:03.910
He's finally showed up!

00:24:03.910 --> 00:24:04.850
Who has?

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:05.930
Tojo, man! Tojo!

00:24:06.300 --> 00:24:09.620
Tojo, of the TKKH! The 
strongest man in Ishiyama!

